  "scope": "First observed downloads from two newly uploaded asset paths, then one repeat each on the same available Codespace. Exact same image bytes; distinct paths verified by hash. Four ranges and serial are sequential, in that order. Origin/CDN caches and network traffic are not controlled. No Docker load or full product launch is measured. No existing app data or image caches are changed.",
